msgctxt "164"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Did you buy my Shonen Five!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Yeah, I got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Woohoo! Gimme!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Hold on a sec."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"(...That Shonen Five editor said he'd wait for me in\r\n"
"front of the OPA building.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"(Just to be safe, I should probably hold onto this issue.\r\n"
"It's got Hirano's work in it, after all. Might be useful\r\n"
" later.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "C'mon! Lemme have it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "You're gonna have to wait a little longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Wait, why!? Come on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"I have to show this magazine to someone else first. I'll\r\n"
"be back with it as soon as I'm done, I swear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Awww!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "I'll pay for the manga to make up for the added wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Mngh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"I won't be long. I'll come right back when it's done,\r\n"
"and it'll be all yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Fine... But make it quick, okay!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "I promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Did you buy my Shonen Five!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Yeah, I got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Woohoo! Gimme!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"...wait, this isn't it! I wanted Shonen Five! Did you\r\n"
"forget to buy it for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Nah, I was just messing with you. I'll be back with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Sorry, I don't have it right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Wait, what!? You were supposed to buy it, though!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "I will, just give me a little more time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "This is it, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "You handed over the <Color:8>Shonen Five<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Yeah, just what I wanted! Thanks, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

